# Every docked screen at Lave that is still 1987's, from the start of a game: the status screen it opens on,
# then F4 to F7, F10 and Esc. Both charts move their cursor; the equipment screen buys a missile. F2, F3 and F8
# open the market, D01 (D92), which its known answers and its golden image test instead.
wait 3
key space; wait 4                  # any key: the credits, then the status screen
